OL,3,GNEWSA'Academy plan' strike shuts
OL,4,Aschools for second day
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Catholic schools in Lancashire have
OL,7,Fagain closed as staff return to the
OL,8,Fpicket line over plans to take them
OL,9,Finto academy trusts.
OL,11,FDozens of staff at Corpus Christi
OL,12,FCatholic High School in Fulwood,
OL,13,FPreston, and Cardinal Allen Catholic
OL,14,FHigh School in Fleetwood are taking a
OL,15,Fsecond day of strike action.
OL,17,FThe National Education Union's
OL,18,FLancashire branch secretary Ian
OL,19,FWatkinson said industrial action was
OL,20,Fthe last resort but stressed that his
OL,21,Fmembers were worried the change would
OL,22,F"put jobs at risk".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
