OL,3,GNEWSA'Academy plan' strike shuts
OL,4,Aschools for second day
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Diocese of Lancaster said it
OL,7,Fregretted the latest walkouts and
OL,8,Finsisted the plans would guarantee
OL,9,F"high quality Catholic education".
